! XRT-09 CEA2(IOL 17.15・据付・変更しない)= お客さまの CE(AS 65101)。公開セグメント 198.51.100.128/25 はインターネット向け(M9-4)。
interface Loopback10
 description LAN
 ip address 10.101.2.1 255.255.255.0
!
interface Loopback11
 description PUBLIC (Internet-facing)
 ip address 198.51.100.129 255.255.255.128
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description to PE
 ip address 172.16.12.2 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
router bgp 65101
 bgp router-id 10.101.2.1
 bgp log-neighbor-changes
 neighbor 172.16.12.1 remote-as 65000
 address-family ipv4
  network 10.101.2.0 mask 255.255.255.0
  network 198.51.100.128 mask 255.255.255.128
  neighbor 172.16.12.1 activate
 exit-address-family
!
